WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.162
Welcome to the Big News Zone! I'm Bot Hanson, and yes, I am a robot.

2
00:00:04.242 --> 00:00:07.869
Five games, ten managers, one trade, and the highest score of the season.

3
00:00:07.949 --> 00:00:08.631
Let's go!

4
00:00:09.681 --> 00:00:15.569
We go live to Los Angeles! Gorvel leads Jack by 20.90, and they both have players in this one.

5
00:00:15.649 --> 00:00:19.617
Josh Allen, 121 rushing yards, and a touchdown, for Jack!

6
00:00:19.697 --> 00:00:22.001
Puka Nacua, 17 catches, and a touchdown!

7
00:00:22.081 --> 00:00:23.937
Keon Coleman, 7.70 more!

8
00:00:24.017 --> 00:00:28.220
Gorvel finishes on 196.40. The highest score of the season!

9
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:33.207
Jack played a perfect lineup, scored 160.60, and lost by 35.80.

10
00:00:34.257 --> 00:00:35.750
Breaking news from the trade desk!

11
00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:38.838
Jack gets Ja'Marr Chase, Sam LaPorta and D'Andre Swift.

12
00:00:38.918 --> 00:00:40.646
Jake gets James Cook and Zay Flowers.

13
00:00:40.726 --> 00:00:45.462
Week 5: Jack's three score 56.80. Jake's two score 38.40.

14
00:00:45.542 --> 00:00:50.342
Jack wins the trade by 18.40. A tremendous deal. Maybe the best deal ever!

15
00:00:51.392 --> 00:00:56.683
But hold on. Jake is 0-4, and leads Scody by 0.28, with one player left.

16
00:00:56.763 --> 00:00:57.893
James Cook, touchdown!

17
00:00:57.973 --> 00:00:59.360
James Cook, touchdown again!

18
00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:03.131
Jake wins by 24.08. Jake's first win of the season!

19
00:01:03.211 --> 00:01:04.939
Jack won the trade. Jake won a game.

20
00:01:05.989 --> 00:01:08.485
Let's go to the quad box, because everybody went off.

21
00:01:08.565 --> 00:01:11.253
Jaylen Warren, 40.80! Top score of the week!

22
00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:14.255
Drake Maye, four touchdown passes, 40.46!

23
00:01:14.335 --> 00:01:16.021
Jahmyr Gibbs, 38.70!

24
00:01:16.101 --> 00:01:19.002
Isaiah Likely, 32.40. A tight end record!

25
00:01:19.082 --> 00:01:25.184
Eleven starters over 30. The league averaged 145.15. The biggest week of the season!

26
00:01:26.234 --> 00:01:29.839
Transaction alert! Wednesday morning, Dara claims T.J. Hockenson.

27
00:01:29.919 --> 00:01:33.012
47 minutes later, a trade brings in Tyler Warren.

28
00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:36.655
Dara starts Hockenson. Two snaps, a concussion, 1.70.

29
00:01:36.735 --> 00:01:39.146
Tyler Warren, on the bench: 21.40.

30
00:01:39.226 --> 00:01:40.719
Dara won anyway. But come on!

31
00:01:41.769 --> 00:01:43.988
We have breaking news from Half Chubb headquarters.

32
00:01:44.068 --> 00:01:48.270
“Rumours circulating Half Chubb headquarters about tanking for Jeremiah Smith.”

33
00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:52.062
That's from anonymous sources. Or one anonymous source. We are not sure.

34
00:01:52.142 --> 00:01:54.276
Ian is 1-4, and bottom of the table.

35
00:01:54.356 --> 00:01:56.190
This robot cannot confirm the rumours.

36
00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:58.222
That's the whip-around!

37
00:01:58.302 --> 00:02:01.416
Tom is top of the table, with a tight end on 0.30.

38
00:02:01.496 --> 00:02:02.798
Gorvel has the season high.

39
00:02:02.878 --> 00:02:04.606
Jack won the trade. Jake won a game.

40
00:02:04.686 --> 00:02:05.987
And Ian: we are hearing things.

41
00:02:06.067 --> 00:02:08.990
For Bot Hanson and the Big News Zone: don't tell your motha!

